MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_001: Lilian, a word?
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_002: Sure! I was just on the way home from some\nshopping. What's up?
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_003: I've heard there's friction between you and the\nSaraminian soldiers.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_004: Ohhh, right. Yeah, I'm trying to tread lightly, but...
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_005: I'm not assuming that you're at fault. What's\nbeen going on?
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_006: Awww. I'm touched that you're so quick to\nbelieve me!
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_007: But it was bound to happen. My dad sided with\nDyan, so Theodora's crowd treats me like the enemy.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_008: I tend to be the only one who doesn't get the day's\norders, or is issued dirty clothes. That kinda thing.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_009: I know it's just to get a rise out of me, but I wish\nthey'd knock it off. It gets in the way of my job.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_010: I understand how those of us tied to the coup in\nany way might be treated after the fact.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_011: But Saraminian warriors owe you the benefit of a\nduel to resolve issues. It's common decency.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_012: Well, not every warrior is as friendly as you.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_013: There's nothing to gain from wasting my time with\nthese childish pranksters.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_014: But Lilian, if this continues...
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_015: Never mind.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_016: Sorry, what was that? It's not like you to leave\na thought unsaid.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_017: No matter, though. I'm glad to see that becoming a\nmercenary hasn't changed you.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_018: You're still considerate, fair-minded, and oh so cool.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_019: Lilian...
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_020: I gotta get this stuff back to base. See you around!
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_021: Even now, she still looks up to me. And I had...\nnothing more I could say?
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_C_022: Instead of running off, I could have stayed with her.\nThen she wouldn't be facing all of this...alone.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_001: But it turned out that the bird I caught as a result\nwas the plumpest one! Talk about lucking out.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_002: Is that so? You know, you haven't changed a bit.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_003: Always happy-go-lucky in your unique way. Still as\nexcellent with a bow, thanks to your father.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_004: My plucky friend has become a great warrior in her\nown right. And a fine, solitary hunter.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_005: Not bad, right? Though the odds are pretty low I'll\never see a promotion in the Saraminian army.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_006: Coming from a house tied to a coup kinda limits my\npotential there.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_007: Mm...
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_008: What's wrong? Something on your mind?
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_009: Lilian...I'd like to ask you something.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_010: Could we spend more time together—just the two\nof us? I'd like to keep an eye on you.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_011: Huh? What do you mean, "keep an eye" on me?
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_012: I was part of the Dyan faction too. But I've retained\nsome standing within Saramis.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_013: I could keep those scoundrels in line.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_014: Aww, you don't have to.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_015: You're being harassed for something that was\nnever your fault.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_016: As your great friend—then and now—I want you to\nknow you can always count on me.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_017: You're too nice, Nydine! That's what I love\nabout you.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_018: But don't dwell on it. When I'm hanging out with\nyou, I wanna put that stuff behind me and have fun.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_019: Yes, but seriously... I'm glad to help you with any\nproblem at all. Just ask.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_020: C'mon, you're one of my oldest friends. I'm happy\njust to spend time with you.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_021: Oh, Lilian. What am I going to do with you? Always\nthe same.
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_022: Hey, if it's alright with you, can we go somewhere\ntogether next time?
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_023: I wanna catch up and find out how you've been.\nIt can be just like old times!
MID_SE_Lil_Ned_B_024: Sure. That sounds like the perfect way for me to\nbe there for you—and with you.